# ADR-019 D-19.12: a wrong-path load may fill the D-cache but must leave no
# architectural result. The wrong-path load misses a never-touched line; a later
# correct-path load of the same line must see the memory value.
@name ooo-wrong-path-load-no-result
@verifies propWrongPathLoadNoResult funcLoadComplete funcLoadIssue funcDCacheMshr propDCacheLoadAnswerExactlyOnce
@verifies funcDCacheViptLookup funcDCachePortArbitrate
@maxcycles 4000
li x9, 0x55
li x11, 0x90000
beq x0, x0, skip
lw x9, 0(x11)
skip: check x9 == 0x55
lw x12, 0(x11)
check x12 == 0x13
